<p>The log's value: when problems occur, quickly trace which step had oversight—instead of "everyone shares blame, case closed."</p>
<hr />
<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>
<p>Compliance audits aren't technical wizardry—they require execution and discipline. <strong>Turning audits from "do it when remembered" to "mandatory step before launch" is the simplest, most effective way to reduce account risk.</strong></p>
<p>If your team lacks this SOP, start with Step 1—creative compliance checks. Build the habit first, then gradually expand coverage.</p>
